WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:08.026
ROW_NUMBER RANK and DENSE_RANK look similar until
ties occur ROW_NUMBER

00:00:08.053 --> 00:00:13.691
always assigns a unique sequence RANK gives equal
values the same

00:00:13.704 --> 00:00:19.262
rank and leaves gaps afterward DENSE_RANK also
shares ranks

00:00:19.275 --> 00:00:24.803
but does not leave gaps Choose the function based on
what ties should mean

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.027
for the business question
